      "value": "If you have checked how the \"normalized time\" works, you probably know you should do some work at both your gesture and FX animation, and the animation file with \"proxy_\" as the beginning of the name will be replaced to VRChat built-in aniimation, rename it will let VRChat consider that ypu're using custome animation and won't replace them.",
