      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To let facial expression and hand gesture's analog control work by VR controller trigger, you need to set your animation at least two frame, the first frame is default value and second frame set to what you want, to setup hand gesture, you need copy the idle pose of your hand to be the first frame instead of put animated pose at both freames.",
      "viewerReactions": null
